# Tracked application database

`database/database.sqlite` is the project data backup. There is no separate backup.

- Keep it tracked (`database/.gitignore` already allows this file).
- Include it in commits when it has changed, including alongside feature work.
- Do not treat it as a secret, generated artifact, or file to leave unstaged.
